WEBVTT

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:30.934
To help communicate what's valued

00:13:30.958 --> 00:13:34.934
and to help tap into
that emotional way that we all decide.

00:13:34.958 --> 00:13:36.476
As you all move forward,

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.934
shaping the passion and purpose
of others as leaders,

00:13:39.958 --> 00:13:41.476
don't just use data.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.059
Use stories.

00:13:43.083 --> 00:13:45.018
And don't wait for the perfect story.

00:13:45.042 --> 00:13:47.518
Take your story and make it perfect.

00:13:47.542 --> 00:13:48.809
Thank you.

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:50.458
(Applause)